---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy | Huuhka.net" description="Analytics and third-party services on Pasi Huuhka's blog.">
  <main id="main" class="privacy-page page-width">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>This blog is run by Pasi Huuhka. Comments are optional and load only when requested.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>This site uses Umami Cloud to measure visits, popular pages, and traffic sources.
      Umami does not use analytics cookies. It receives page views and referrers along with
      information such as browser, device, language, and approximate location.</p>
    <p>Analytics loads automatically on the public site. This site removes query strings and
      URL fragments from the page addresses and referrers it reports, and honors your
      browser's Do Not Track setting. Local and preview sites do not load analytics.
      Google Analytics is no longer loaded.</p>
    <p>Umami Cloud Hobby currently retains analytics data for six months.
      See <a href="https://umami.is/privacy">Umami's privacy policy</a>{' '}
      and <a href="https://umami.is/docs/data-collection">data collection documentation</a>{' '}
      for details about processing and visitor statistics.</p>
    <h2>Comments</h2>
    <p>Comments use giscus and public GitHub Discussions. The comment service only loads after
      you choose Show comments. Loading it connects your browser to giscus and GitHub.
      Commenting requires GitHub sign-in, and comments are public. Loading comments
      does not change how analytics works.</p>
    <p>See the <a href="https://github.com/giscus/giscus/blob/main/PRIVACY-POLICY.md">giscus privacy policy</a>{' '}
      and <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
    <h2>Hosting and embedded content</h2>
    <p>Azure hosts the site and its images. Hosting providers receive network information needed
      to serve requests. Some older articles include external media, such as videos. Those services
      have their own privacy practices and are separate from Umami analytics.</p>
    <h2>Questions or removal requests</h2>
    <p>Contact <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pasihuuhka/">Pasi on LinkedIn</a>{' '}
      with privacy questions or requests concerning comments.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
<style>
  .privacy-page { max-width: 720px; padding-block: 40px; }
  h1 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  h2 { font-size: 24px; margin-block: 32px 12px; }
  p { margin-block: 16px; }
  a { color: var(--link); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
